{"_id":"68a7360d8ec3d8323af1240e","nodeId":"ffzsh8_5yRq85trFt9Xhk","roadmapSlug":"backend","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:53.149Z","description":"# Cookie-Based Authentication\n\nCookie-based authentication maintains user sessions by storing session IDs in browser cookies. Server stores session data and uses cookies as keys. Simple to implement and browser-native, but vulnerable to CSRF attacks and challenging for cross-origin requests.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"HTTP Cookies - MDN Web Docs","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Cookies","_id":"6a7588bab0650226a5eb4653"},{"type":"article","title":"Session vs Token Authentication","url":"https://www.section.io/engineering-education/token-based-vs-session-based-authentication/","_id":"6a7588bab0650226a5eb4654"},{"type":"video","title":"Session vs Token Authentication in 100 Seconds","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UBUNrFtufWo","_id":"6a7588bab0650226a5eb4655"},{"type":"video","title":"How do cookies work?","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rdVPflECed8","_id":"6a7588bab0650226a5eb4656"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-07T07:26:50.654Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04ddfb5fcb94d0416a0d","title":"Scrimba - Backend Developer Career Path","partner":"Scrimba","type":"course","url":"http://scrimba.com/the-backend-developer-path-c0tbi0l98f?via=roadmap"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/backend/content/ffzsh8_5yRq85trFt9Xhk.md"}